WEEK 9 — REPLACING THE QR SCANNER WITH A BARCODE READER

Date: Monday, 5 October 2026

Problem: The QR code on the tag was still read, off-centre tags were missed, and the phone camera would not open over plain HTTP.

Solution:
- Allowed only linear barcode formats (EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC, Code 128, Code 39, ITF) and turned QR off.
- Scanned a wide band in the middle every 90 ms, and the full frame every 4th pass.
- Ran the dev server over HTTPS so the phone camera works.
- Ignored the same code for 2.2 seconds, so one scan does not add the item twice.
- Measured one decode at 25 to 35 ms per frame.
